sipsak
------------------------------------------
SIP swiss army knife

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcares2-1.34.9-1
  libgnutls30-3.8.13-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  check-0.15.2-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libcares-devel-1.34.9-1
  libgnutls-devel-3.8.13-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/nils-ohlmeier/sipsak

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/nils-ohlmeier/sipsak/archive/refs/tags/0.9.8.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack sipsak-0.9.8.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./sipsak-0.9.8.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/sipsak-0.9.8.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/sipsak-0.9.8.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(sipsak)
  /usr/bin/sipsak.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/sipsak.README
  /usr/share/doc/sipsak/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/sipsak/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/sipsak/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/sipsak/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/sipsak/README
  /usr/share/doc/sipsak/TODO
  /usr/share/man/man1/sipsak.1.gz

------------------

